+---
+enhancements:
+  - |
+    Added an `encoding` parameter to `PDFMinerToDocument`. PDFs whose text bytes do not match the
+    encoding declared by their fonts were indexed as mojibake (for example `cafÃ©` instead of
+    `café`). The extracted text is now converted to UTF-8 using the given encoding, and setting
+    `encoding="auto"` detects it with `chardet`.
